sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as "Admin/HR"
    participant View as "Web View (admin.leave.show)"
    participant Controller as "LeaveRequestController"
    participant Model as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Klik detail pengajuan cuti
    View->>Controller: GET /leaves/{id}
    Controller->>Model: getById(id)
    Model->>DB: SELECT leave_request + worker + leave_type + approver
    DB-->>Model: Data detail pengajuan
    Model-->>Controller: Entitas LeaveRequest

    alt Data valid (ID ditemukan)
        Controller->>View: Render halaman detail pengajuan
        View-->>Admin: Detail cuti, lampiran, status tampil
    else Data tidak valid (ID tidak ditemukan/error)
        Controller->>View: Redirect back + error
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi data tidak ditemukan
    end
